                            448 
                            449 ; -----------------------------------------------------
                            450 ; Phrases (each holds a list of word pointers)
                            451 ; -----------------------------------------------------
                            452 ;All valid weight messages include ...
                            453 ;
                            454 ;   Greeting message (waiting for the weight to settle)
                            455 ;   the weight message
                            456 ;   comment.
